# A root `pnpm install` is now possible (package.json declares the toolchain for
# Vercel/CI). It has no dependencies, so it installs nothing — but pnpm still
# materialises both of these at the root. Neither is authoritative: the only real
# manifest and lockfile are atlas/package.json and atlas/pnpm-lock.yaml.
